{"id":"wb-8-644","name":"开封伞塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"开封伞塔","text":"开封伞塔是位于中国河南省开封市禹王台区的一座伞降训练塔。1955年9月动工，1956年6月建成使用，曾供军队空降兵和跳伞运动员训练。2019年，开封伞塔以“近现代重要史迹及代表性建筑”列入第八批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%BC%80%E5%B0%81%E4%BC%9E%E5%A1%94","revisionId":95427883,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95427883","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/232e40845ccfe02f4571e1a9.jpg","title":"20250510_Kaifeng_Parachute_Tower_01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20250510_Kaifeng_Parachute_Tower_01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/44/20250510_Kaifeng_Parachute_Tower_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Kaifeng Parachute Tower","width":320,"height":213}}